{#- Check it's us: the firm's register entry first (so visitors check the regulator, not our word), then the only numbers
    and email addresses it uses, what it will never ask, and the FCA's ScamSmart. -#}
{%- set c = site.check %}
{%- set ph = { title: c.title, intro: c.intro } %}
{% include "kits/ifa/partials/page-head.njk" %}
<section class="if-chk" data-feature="ifa-check"><div class="wrap if-chk-in">
  <div>
    <h2>Check us on the register</h2>
    <p>Our firm reference number is <b>{{ site.regulation.frn }}</b>{{ site.mode | demoTag }}. <a href="{{ site.regulation.registerUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open our entry on the FCA's register</a> and check the phone numbers and website there match ours.</p>
    <h2>We only call from</h2>
    <ul class="if-chk-list">{% for p in c.phones %}<li><span>{{ p.label }}</span><a href="tel:{{ p.number | replace(' ', '') }}">{{ p.number | replace('+44 ', '0') }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <h2>We only email from</h2>
    <ul class="if-chk-list">{% for d in c.domains %}<li><span>Addresses ending</span><b>@{{ d }}</b></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>We will never</h2>
    <ul class="if-chk-never">{% for n in c.never %}<li>{{ n }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <p>{{ c.callback }}</p>
    <p>If something feels wrong, the FCA's <a href="{{ fca.scamsmart }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ScamSmart</a> explains how to check a firm and report a scam.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>
